      "title": "MonetrixVault.claimRedeem hard-codes payOut(msg.sender, ...): a USDC blacklist of the redeemer between requestRedeem and claimRedeem permanently strands the user's USDM, the obligation, and the funded escrow USDC",
      "uid": "5yjseW7eSkE",
